  "2026-07-29T04:40:18.469Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check before create: pm-ffz0a9 owns the model RESOLVER (how a non-environment source supplies the value); pm-rbg1qo owns descriptor COVERAGE per harness for topic, effort and role; pm-gw6uyq owns the derived ANALYTICS and explicitly assumes grouping by harness and model is possible; pm-itsjf0 is CLOSED and shipped the extensible dimension schema; pm-0zcwz6 is CLOSED and honestly recorded model capture as inert; pm-z8qd4k owns the claim-principal collapse, a different consequence of the same one-value author. None of them owns the read projection or the predicate. Searched keyword and semantic for provenance filter, projection, harness grouping; grepped the corpus for agent_provenance, which returns only 4k6b, itsjf0, 0zcwz6, ffz0a9 and rbg1qo."
